rmdir missing        -> ENOENT
rmdir regular file   -> ENOTDIR
rmdir non-empty      -> ENOTEMPTY_OR_EEXIST
rmdir dot            -> EINVAL
rmdir symlink->dir   -> ENOTDIR
rmdir file/          -> ENOTDIR
rmdir through file   -> ENOTDIR
rmdir empty          -> OK
rmdir empty again    -> ENOENT
unlink directory     -> EISDIR_OR_EPERM
unlink missing       -> ENOENT
unlink dir symlink   -> OK
unlink file symlink  -> OK
unlink dangling      -> OK
unlink through file  -> ENOTDIR
rmdir full (sub left) -> ENOTEMPTY_OR_EEXIST
rmdir full (emptied) -> OK
